{"id":"steam-991450","steam":991450,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Wild Ranger: Gun X Dragon","summary":"融合西部荒野与魔幻。在这个人类与魔物并存的架空世界，寻人之旅中的流浪枪手马克斯·贝恩与幼龙卓克，命运的旋涡正一步一步将他们卷入其中。","about":"茫然砂海，辽阔荒野。在这个世界中，曾一度灌溉大地的水源已经崩坏。有为了恢复水源再生系统而身陷险境的人，有在这荒野寻找其他水源的人，也有适应荒野努力活着的人。跟随马克斯·贝恩的脚步，结识怀有不同目的的同伴，探索世界的每个角落，为活着的人寻找希望，为已故的人弥补遗憾。\r\n\r\n\r\n游戏特色\r\n\n• 令人热血沸腾的西部世界\r\n• 紧凑的主线剧情\r\n• 各式各样的支线任务\r\n• 优美的户外地图、怪物图形\r\n• 回合制战斗，但并不是需要练级\r\n• 超过30种敌人，每一个都有自己的特色","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/library_600x900.jpg?t=1584698400","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/header.jpg?t=1584698400","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/library_hero.jpg?t=1584698400","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/header.jpg?t=1584698400","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1584698400","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/ss_7f1699dbd65fef8e46c8befb09cd3c8da5f90b6e.600x338.jpg?t=1584698400","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/ss_7f1699dbd65fef8e46c8befb09cd3c8da5f90b6e.jpg?t=1584698400"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/ss_26f7355cd37522a0390d39dc59bc3b363462627e.600x338.jpg?t=1584698400","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/ss_26f7355cd37522a0390d39dc59bc3b363462627e.jpg?t=1584698400"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/ss_a24b3cfcf8055051c112253ece51f64181678031.600x338.jpg?t=1584698400","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/991450/ss_a24b3cfcf8055051c112253ece51f64181678031.jpg?t=1584698400"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item